OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fwith the chance of an odd shower
OL,7,Fthrough the evening and overnight. The
OL,8,Ffresh westerly wind will fall light
OL,9,Fand changeable towards the morning.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FAfter a dry start rain will
OL,12,Fspread northeast during the morning.
OL,13,FThis clears in the afternoon but
OL,14,Fremaining rather cloudy, chance of
OL,15,Fhaar. The wind will freshen during the
OL,16,Fmorning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
