OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,6,Fband of cloud and rain will pass
OL,7,Fsoutheast Tuesday, bright spells and
OL,8,Fshowers following on Wednesday. Drier
OL,9,FThursday until rain and strong winds
OL,10,Ffrom the west in the afternoon.
